--- !u!114 &1030226565
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1030226563}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "You wake in The Glade with no memory of how you arrived. The octagonal
    walls tower above you, ancient and unforgiving. Every dawn, the maze doors open.
    Every dusk, they seal shut. \n<color=#FFD700>THE RULES ARE SIMPLE. SURVIVAL IS
    NOT.</color>\r\r\n<color=#FFD700>EXPLORE THE MAZE</color>\r\nVenture into the
    shifting corridors before nightfall. Each day brings new paths, new mysteries.\r\r\n<color=#FFD700>FIND
    THE PUZZLE ROOMS</color>\r\nHidden throughout the maze are chambers that hold
    the key to escape. Solve their riddles. Unlock their secrets.\r\r\n<color=#FFD700>RETURN
    BEFORE DARK</color>\r\nWhen the sun sets, the maze transforms. What hunts in
    the darkness shows no mercy.\r \r\n<color=#FFD700>THE POWER WITHIN</color>\r\nYou
    possess a gift - the ability to conjure fire. Use it wisely. Your power may be
    the only thing standing between you and the night. The clock is always ticking.
    The walls remember everything. The eighth day approaches. Will you find the truth
    before the maze claims you? Or will you become another echo lost in its depths?\r\n\r\n<color=#FFD700>[CONTROLS]</color>\r\n<color=#FFD700>WASD</color>
    - Move\r\n<color=#FFD700>Mouse</color> - Look Around\r\n<color=#FFD700>Right
    Click</color> - Shoot Fireball\r\n<color=#FFD700>ESC</color> - Pause\r\n\r\nThe
    maze awaits. Time is running out."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c7e951bfec0f80942b7d830c88a7a263, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -5516995133297626616, guid: c7e951bfec0f80942b7d830c88a7a263, type: 2}
